{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/e101bead341477fd1bdffa553582a9df.avif?t=1765930971\" width=600 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Whaleville!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s first town inside a whale. It\u2019s friendly, a little odd and utterly charming. Explore every corner of this peculiar place, help the locals \u2014 and maybe they\u2019ll help you find a way out. Or... maybe you\u2019ll decide to stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/0b7942d3315801d617d02cba2bd13421.poster.avif?t=1765930971\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/0b7942d3315801d617d02cba2bd13421.webm?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/0b7942d3315801d617d02cba2bd13421.mp4?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart Your Own Course</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the wheel, wind up the key \u2014 you're the captain of your own boat. Where will your journey take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/bd7b1a6db5964b853ce38396e62fab7b.poster.avif?t=1765930971\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/bd7b1a6db5964b853ce38396e62fab7b.webm?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/bd7b1a6db5964b853ce38396e62fab7b.mp4?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Unexpected</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whaleville is full of hidden nooks and quiet surprises. Pick a direction, follow your instincts, and see what you discover \u2014 there's something new around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/c8dd9bf5c242f80e673f4b37abb4c85f.poster.avif?t=1765930971\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/c8dd9bf5c242f80e673f4b37abb4c85f.webm?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/c8dd9bf5c242f80e673f4b37abb4c85f.mp4?t=1765930971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make New Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locals are a peculiar bunch. Some tell bad jokes. Some ask deep questions. Some just enjoy sitting in the sun. Who will you meet today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445590/extras/cfd1ffff08a71b4f89580a3501a9474a.avif?t=1765930971\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s the Rush?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A no-pressure adventure. No timers. No fail states. Just gentle exploration at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p 